==About==
{{#section:Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2025|Intro}}

The '''RLCS 2025 Birmingham Major''' {{IsTournamentFinished|took|will take|is taking}} place in Birmingham, England at the [https://www.bppulselive.co.uk/ bp pulse LIVE] arena.

===Format===
[[File:RLCS Swiss Format.jpg|thumbnail|335px|A graphical explanation of the Swiss System format]]
*'''Swiss Stage''' - ''March 27th - 28th, 2025''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format.
*** All matches are {{Bo|5}}.
** <span class="bg-up">Top 8</span> Teams proceed to the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2025/Birmingham Major#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
<br>
*'''Playoffs''' - ''March 29th - 30th, 2025''
**AFL Final Eight system.
**Top 4 of the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2025/Birmingham Major#Swiss Stage|Swiss Stage]] start with two chances before the Final Four, whereas teams ranked 5th-8th start with one chance.
***All matches are {{Bo|7}}.
<br>
''Crowd Days: March 29th - 30th''

